{
 "id": "control-mode",
 "order": 9,
 "name": "Control All & Parameter change absolute/relative",
 "description": [
  "Hold TRACK + tap SETTINGS: CONTROL ALL switches between Relative (firmware: every track moves by the same amount",
  "and stops at its limit) and Absolute (all tracks take the new value of the selected track).",
  "Applies to TRACK + knob, TRACK + LEVEL (volume), FUNC + TRACK + LEVEL (pan) and the humanize of patch 08.",
  "Global setting, kept after power-off.",
  "Hold TRACK: trig LEDs 1..6 show which tracks CONTROL ALL affects (blinking); TRACK + trig 1..6 adds or removes a",
  "track (the active track always takes part). All tracks are on after every start.",
  "Track selection: idea from model27 by durchgemacht (MIT); own code."
 ],
 "device": "Model:Cycles OS 1.13 (also a Model:Samples running it)",
